{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53738","headline":"太白经附颂 · 施肩吾","name":"太白经附颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神水华池便是丹，东西高下自相看。\n劝君莫把凡铅弄，活计生涯便好捐。\n铅则何妨本自铅，铅中何处觅神仙？\n东西南北还丹了，争奈仙家不肯传。\n同色同名合好音，亦能烁烁亦沉沉。\n乾坤颠倒驱雷雨，龙跃安能出上阴？\n（《正统道藏》本《太白经》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}